        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4d9b5b5a-6038-4f40-9321-f262d3aa7fd9",
      "content": "Cross-Border Work\n\nNorthstar does not guarantee approval for work from any country. Temporary cross-border work requires People Operations review before travel. The company does not maintain a formal visa or immigration policy in the employee knowledge base.\n\nRequests to work outside Canada or the United States are considered ambiguous until People Operations reviews tax, employment, and security implications.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "document_title": "Remote and Hybrid Work Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "f021f971-ac5a-407f-adc5-e8abec25fd9d",
      "content": "Remote Work\n\nRemote work must follow this policy and the Remote and Hybrid Work Policy. Employees working remotely are responsible for using secure networks, avoiding shared public computers, and protecting screens from unauthorized viewing.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-002",
      "document_title": "Device and BYOD Security Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "66a0bffd-898c-4c16-abf0-817b06af59d3",
      "content": "Personal Devices\n\nPersonal devices may be used for limited work access only when enrolled in approved mobile device management or when access occurs through approved browser-based tools. Personal devices must use a passcode, supported operating system, and automatic lock.\n\nRestricted data must not be downloaded to personal devices. Confidential data should be accessed only through approved company systems.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-002",
      "document_title": "Device and BYOD Security Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "47b76ced-caf6-4234-b966-1a9cbde9e540",
      "content": "Approval Requirements\n\nEmployees must receive manager approval before changing their regular work location. A temporary change within the same country for fewer than 15 business days may be approved by the manager. Longer changes require People Operations review.\n\nManagers should consider team coverage, customer needs, time zone overlap, and data handling requirements before approving remote work.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "document_title": "Remote and Hybrid Work Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4ec63d09-594a-4640-b1f7-5db5f5b9b238",
      "content": "Work Model\n\nNorthstar supports hybrid work and approved remote work. Employees assigned to Toronto, Montreal, or New York offices are expected to attend office collaboration days when scheduled by their department.\n\nRemote employees may work from approved locations in Canada or the United States if their role, tax location, and security requirements support remote work.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "document_title": "Remote and Hybrid Work Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "47fe8690-3f57-4a00-99a4-17175db78840",
      "content": "Security Expectations\n\nRemote work must follow the Device and BYOD Security Policy and the Data Classification and Handling Policy. Confidential and restricted data may only be accessed on approved devices using company-approved tools.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "document_title": "Remote and Hybrid Work Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "e63e8dbf-a320-4863-83cf-939dd76f89ca",
      "content": "Company Devices\n\nEmployees who regularly access company systems should use a company-managed device. Company devices must have disk encryption, endpoint protection, automatic screen lock, and current operating system updates.\n\nEmployees may not disable security tools or remove device management controls from company devices.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-002",
      "document_title": "Device and BYOD Security Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b6f7d058-c59b-40e2-bf9b-3a560a873391",
      "content": "Related Policies\n\nFor time off, consult the PTO and Leave Policy. For remote work, consult the Remote and Hybrid Work Policy. For acceptable technology use, consult the Acceptable Use Policy.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "document_title": "Employee Handbook",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "73cda377-3fd2-4907-b799-92db1cc31555",
      "content": "Not Covered\n\nThis policy does not provide legal advice, immigration advice, or guaranteed approval for international remote work.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "document_title": "Remote and Hybrid Work Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7a7d5ae9-d0ec-448e-972f-f4303132fd00",
      "content": "Related Policies\n\nDevice requirements are defined in the Device and BYOD Security Policy. Data handling requirements are defined in the Data Classification and Handling Policy.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-001",
      "document_title": "Acceptable Use Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
