        "content_preview": "Cross-Border Work\n\nNorthstar does not guarantee approval for work from any country. Temporary cross-border work requires People Operations review before travel. The company does not maintain a formal visa or immigration policy in the employee knowledge base.\n\nRequests to work outside Canada or the United States are considered ambiguous until People Operations reviews tax, employment, and security implications.",
