        "content_preview": "Work Model\n\nNorthstar supports hybrid work and approved remote work. Employees assigned to Toronto, Montreal, or New York offices are expected to attend office collaboration days when scheduled by their department.\n\nRemote employees may work from approved locations in Canada or the United States if their role, tax location, and security requirements support remote work.",
